{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>iFlashlight Pro 可把 iPhone 或 iPad 變成快速可靠的光源，適合夜間閱讀、停電照明、外出找路或緊急求助時使用。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-137.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>多種照明模式隨手切換</h2>\n<p>可滑動調整 LED 閃光燈亮度，由柔和微光到全亮；SOS 模式會自動發出可辨識的閃爍訊號；Instant Light 一鍵即達全亮。若沒有閃光燈或需要更寬廣光線，可將螢幕變成白光或黃光，適合床上閱讀、在袋中找物或照亮房間。介面設計簡潔，按鍵大而易按。連續使用閃光燈可能加快耗電。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-131-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-132-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-133-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-134-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：iFlashlight Pro</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/iflashlight-pro/id392514814?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.408889+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":292,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T14:27:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T19:39:52.700427+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:06.399686+00:00","content_hash":"4ff235df8c7526046335b8c0f6428a53b232b5084f663dca36fe02924aec755d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}